{"language":"cn","values":[["/skills/0/name_i18n/cn","六连开"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/cn","瓦尔克为手枪填装子弹后，逐个射击面前的敌人，造成伤害和眩晕。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","瓦尔克给他的手枪填装6发子弹，随机射向面前的敌人，优先射击本次施放中尚未射击过的敌人。每发子弹造成50% ATK外加目标最大生命值5% + 1%的伤害（外加伤害不超过60% ATK），并使目标眩晕1.5 + 0.2秒。对同一目标的后续命中造成50%的伤害。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":67,"end":72,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg0"},{"start":101,"end":107,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":49,"end":56,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":83,"end":90,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","面前的敌人包含被技能“悬赏追击”悬赏的目标时，在射击过所有面前的敌人之后，剩余的子弹会全部射向被悬赏的敌人。"],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至55% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":12,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至60% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":12,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_i18n/cn","眩晕时间提升至2 + 0.2秒。"],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":8,"end":14,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/1/name_i18n/cn","散弹扫射"],["/skills/1/simple_description_i18n/cn","瓦尔克的普通攻击强化为范围伤害。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","瓦尔克的普通攻击发射3枚可以穿透敌人的子弹，对前方一定范围内的敌人造成伤害，并且主目标总是会受到3枚子弹的伤害，每枚子弹造成34% + 6% ATK伤害。瓦尔克的普通攻击范围无法扩大。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":65,"end":70,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":62,"end":74,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","普通攻击暴击时，对伤害到的敌人造成0.125秒的眩晕。"],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","每枚子弹的伤害提升至37% + 6% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":13,"end":18,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":10,"end":22,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","每枚子弹的伤害提升至40% + 6% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":13,"end":18,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":10,"end":22,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/name_i18n/cn","悬赏追击"],["/skills/2/simple_description_i18n/cn","瓦尔克优先攻击累计输出最高的敌人的悬赏令，期间获得增益效果。"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","战斗开始后第10秒，瓦尔克领取此时累计输出最高的敌人的悬赏令。领取悬赏令后，瓦尔克受到的伤害下降18% + 5%，优先攻击被悬赏的敌人，并且对其造成的伤害提升25% + 5%。被悬赏的敌人被击败时，瓦尔克直至战斗结束提升5 + 3点暴击，至多提升15 + 9点。"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":51,"end":56,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg2"},{"start":82,"end":87,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"},{"start":111,"end":115,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg6"},{"start":125,"end":129,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg7"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","瓦尔克领取悬赏令时，使用手枪对其连开3枪，每枪造成50% ATK外加目标已损失生命值4%的伤害（外加伤害不超过25% ATK）。"],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":25,"end":32,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":55,"end":62,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","被悬赏的敌人被击败后，瓦尔克可以再次领取悬赏令。"],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","瓦尔克领取悬赏令时，使用手枪对其连开3枪，每枪造成55% ATK外加目标已损失生命值4%的伤害（外加伤害不超过25% ATK）。"],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":25,"end":32,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":55,"end":62,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/3/name_i18n/cn","英雄专精"],["/skills/3/simple_description_i18n/cn","提高自身暴击增幅。"],["/skills/3/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身的暴击增幅提升30点。"],["/skills/3/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身的暴击增幅提升40点。"],["/skills/3/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身的暴击增幅提升50点。"],["/skills/4/name_i18n/cn","空爆雷霆"],["/skills/4/simple_description_i18n/cn","瓦尔克在战斗开始时丢出榴弹，造成范围伤害和眩晕。"],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","战斗开始时，瓦尔克朝3名敌人各丢出1枚榴弹，然后掏出手枪来引爆榴弹。榴弹被引爆时，使1格扇形区域内的敌人眩晕2秒、护甲在15秒内下降10%并受到140% ATK伤害。多枚榴弹命中同一目标时，只生效1次。"],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":72,"end":80,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","还能使敌人在15秒内下降10点抗暴击。"],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至150% ATK。"],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":13,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至160% ATK。"],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":13,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/5/name_i18n/cn","觉醒之力"],["/skills/5/simple_description_i18n/cn","瓦尔克首次对被悬赏目标造成伤害时获得护盾。"],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","瓦尔克对被悬赏的敌人首次造成伤害时，获得最大生命值20%的护盾，护盾持续至被悬赏的敌人被击败。"],["/skills/5/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","瓦尔克提高20点暴击，普通攻击对被悬赏的敌人造成暴击时，造成的伤害提升60%，并且这次伤害还附带100点生命汲取。"],["/exclusive_equipment/name_i18n/cn","公义之枪"]]}